ders | All statuses |\n| **Fulfilled-Status Order Value** | Recorded item value associated with orders classified as fulfilled | Complete, Shipped |\n| **Cancelled & Returned Value** | Recorded item value associated with cancelled or returned orders | Cancelled, Returned |\n| **Processing Order Value** | Recorded item value associated with orders still classified as processing | Processing |\n\n### Measurement Scope\n\n- **Dataset:** TheLook eCommerce (Google BigQuery)\n- **Reporting cutoff:** September 30, 2026\n- **Date basis:** Order creation date (`orders.created_at`)\n- **Monetary basis:** Sum of `order_items.sale_price`\n- **Order-level grain:** One record per order after aggregating item-level values\n\n### KPI Reconciliation\n\nRecorded Item Value is partitioned into three mutually exclusive status groups:\n\n**Fulfilled-Status Order Value + Cancelled & Returned Value + Processing Order Value = Recorded Item Value**\n\nThis reconciliation is used to validate the consistency of monetary aggregations across order statuses.\n\n### Measurement Limitations\n\n- TheLook is a synthetic e-commerce dataset.\n- Fulfilled-status order value is an operational metric and does not represent verified or recognized accounting revenue.\n- Cancelled and returned item values should not be interpreted directly as financial losses or refunds.\n- Order statuses reflect the dataset's state at query time, rather than necessarily their historical status at the reporting cutoff.\n- All monetary values represent recorded item sale prices, without adjustments for shipping, taxes, discounts not captured in the item price, or other accounting factors.","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"KPI_query = \"\"\"\n            WITH order_item_totals AS (\n                SELECT \n                    order_id, \n                    COUNT(*) as item_count,\n                    SUM(sale_price) as item_value\n                FROM `bigquery-public-data.thelook_ecommerce.order_items`\n                GROUP BY order_id\n            )\n\n            SELECT \n                ROUND(SUM(i.item_value),2) as recorded_item_value,\n                ROUND(\n                    SUM(\n                        CASE\n                            WHEN o.status IN ('Complete','Shipped')\n                            THEN i.item_value\n                            ELSE 0\n                        END\n                    ),2\n                ) as fulfilled_order_value,\n                \n                ROUND(\n                    SUM(\n                        CASE\n                            WHEN o.status IN ('Cancelled','Returned')\n                            THEN i.item_value\n                            ELSE 0\n                        END\n                    ),2\n                ) as cancelled_returned_value,\n                \n                ROUND(\n                    SUM(\n                        CASE\n                            WHEN o.status = 'Processing'\n                            THEN i.item_value\n                            ELSE 0\n                        END\n                    ), 2\n                ) AS processing_order_value\n\n\n            FROM `bigquery-public-data.thelook_ecommerce.orders` as o\n                LEFT JOIN order_item_totals as i\n                    ON o.order_id = i.order_id\n            WHERE DATE(o.created_at) <= DATE '2026-09-30'\n            \"\"\"\n\nKPI = client.query(KPI_query).to_dataframe()\nKPI","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-09T15:25:03.831520Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-09T15:25:03.831873Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-09T15:25:04.865649Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-11-09T15:25:03.831848Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-09T15:25:04.864901Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stderr","text":"/usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/google/cloud/bigquery/table.py:2086: UserWarning: BigQuery Storage module not found, fetch data with the REST endpoint instead.\n  warnings.warn(\n","outpu