\nThe validation checks for:\n\n- Differences between recorded item value and the sum of status-specific monetary values.\n- Order-level monetary discrepancies exceeding the rounding tolerance of 0.01.\n- Missing recorded item values.\n\n### Validation Results\n\nThe validation queries assess whether the analytical model contains unique order records, complete order-item relationships, consistent item counts, and reconciling monetary values.\n\nThe results are displayed in the tables below and should be reviewed after each execution.\n\n### Conclusion\n\nThese validation checks help ensure that downstream sales, profitability, and customer analyses use a structurally consistent order-level model.\n\n*Note: The checks validate selected structural and numerical properties, not the accuracy of all source transactions. Results may change as the underlying synthetic dataset is updated.*","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"\n# Structural Validation\n\nstructural_validation_sql = \"\"\"\nSELECT\n    COUNT(*) AS total_rows,\n    COUNT(DISTINCT order_id) AS unique_orders,\n\n    COUNTIF(order_id IS NULL) AS missing_order_ids,\n\n    COUNTIF(item_count IS NULL) AS orders_without_items,\n\n    COUNTIF(num_of_item IS NULL) AS missing_recorded_item_count,\n\n    COUNTIF(\n        num_of_item IS NOT NULL\n        AND item_count IS NOT NULL\n        AND num_of_item != item_count\n    ) AS item_count_mismatches\n\nFROM fact_orders\n\"\"\"\n\nstructural_validation = run_fact_orders_query(structural_validation_sql)\nstructural_validation","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-09T15:25:07.032443Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-09T15:25:07.032852Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-09T15:25:08.263717Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-11-09T15:25:07.032817Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-09T15:25:08.262973Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stderr","text":"/usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/google/cloud/bigquery/table.py:2086: UserWarning: BigQuery St